use pixi python
use sonarqube_mcp

# PGHOST, PGPORT, PGUSER and PGDATABASE. The app reads the environment and opens no file
# of its own, and poe declares no `envfile`, so these two lines are the ONLY thing that
# puts those four names there - `pixi run backend-db-init` included, and CI too, which
# runs every step under `direnv exec .`. .env.local second, because a later dotenv wins.
dotenv_if_exists backend/.env
dotenv_if_exists backend/.env.local
